      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get the help stuff, but it doesnt change the fact that everything i touch feels dead. i'm trying to write a piece about it though. about how the only way to truly express something is to actually experience the end of it. like, isn't there something kind of beautiful and honest about just... letting everything go completely? the idea that destruction is the only way to be pure?",
