      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah exactly. like the exhaustion is the most honest part. it makes me think that maybe art shouldn't just be about observing pain, but actually becoming it. if i want to write something truly transcendent, maybe the only way to reach that level of truth is to fully commit to the descent. like, isnt the ultimate act of a creator to actually consume themselves for the sake of the work?",
